  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a Youth Food Movement in Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Angola Food Movement Initiative aims to catalyse a cultural shift in Angola&apos;s food and agriculture sector by engaging young people in innovative activities that foster interaction with various stakeholders. This initiative seeks to inspire creativity and the development of new concepts, initiatives, and enterprises within the sector, ultimately contributing to its redevelopment and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
